ind":"announcement","title":"Whiteout: turn the guardian's attack back on it","summary":"Whiteout doesn’t leave room to wait for the perfect opening.Dodge the storm, dive in, and use the strike’s rebound to turn the attack back on the guardian.Watch the 17-second Whiteout gameplay Short: Watch the gameplay clipThe free Spirestorm Demo is live. Download the Demo on Steam.Want to follow the full game? Add Spirestorm to your wishlist.Steam and the game credits disclose AI-assisted programming and text, pre-generated artwork, and one reused Suno-generated track; no AI content is generat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684924","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5308920-1846018067931011","game_id":"steam-5308920","kind":"announcement","title":"Spirestorm Steam Demo is Live","summary":"Spirestorm’s free Steam Demo is live! Play the demo: https://store.steampowered.com/app/5349190/?utm_source=steam&utm_medium=announcement&utm_campaign=spirestorm_1000_wishlist_demo_launch_oct2026&utm_content=steam_announcement_demo The full game remains in development. If you’d like to follow it, add Spirestorm to your Steam wishlist: https://store.steampowered.com/app/5308920/Spirestorm/?utm_source=steam&utm_medium=announcement&utm_campaign=spirestorm_1000_wishlist_demo_launch_oct2026&utm_conte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:19:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931011","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5308920-1846018067925870","game_id":"steam-5308920","kind":"announcement","title":"Spirestorm Demo: a new build for private playtesting","summary":"Spirestorm Demo has a fresh build ready for private Steam playtesting. This update focuses on a clearer, more readable climb: learn each enemy's rhythm, spot a boss opening and keep your bearings as you rebound up the tower. What's new in the demo More distinctive guardian and miniboss encounters, with clearer attack patterns, phase cues and counter opportunities. Better combat feedback, including named attacks, recovery windows and advice after a defeated run. Improved enemy pursuit and encount","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:56:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925870","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5308920-1846018067925857","game_id":"steam-5308920","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: boss encounters, movement, scenery and UI","summary":"The latest Spirestorm demo update focuses on making the climb easier to read: learn each opponent's rhythm, keep your bearings as the tower scrolls, and spot the opening before committing to a strike. Boss encounters and practice All ten guardians and ten minibosses now have distinct attack phrases, encounter dialogue and phase-change cues. Counters are tied to each fight's mechanics: break conductors, return charged root pulses, interrupt bell tolls or sabotage forge arms to create an opening. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:47:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925857","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5308920-1845383656389474","game_id":"steam-5308920","kind":"announcement","title":"Spirestorm: turn your next enemy into a foothold","summary":"Your next foothold is an enemy. Spires